      "sc:description": "16S-Pipeline is a comprehensive web-based platform designed for end-to-end analysis of 16S rRNA amplicon sequencing data. It provides a complete workflow from raw FASTQ files through quality control, ASV inference, taxonomy assignment, and advanced statistical analyses.",
